  "title": "Delete tag"
 },
 "description": "Permanently delete one workflow tag, which can remove that label from many workflows. tagId must be the stable ID from n8n_tags_list or get; a tag name or workflow ID is not accepted. Review the target and affected workflows first, or use n8n_tags_update when a rename is enough. No rollback is provided. Requires unsafe mode plus tag-delete permission; returns the request-bound tagId with deleted=true.",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
